{"4601710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Egg Smash", "steam_appid": 4601710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/1f05dab6ea024197243841e5e15812c3.avif?t=1778513712\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EggSmash</strong> is a high-speed scramble to hoard chickens. Reach 20 eggs first to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend or Sabotage:</strong> Raid coops to scatter enemy progress or catch the rare <strong>Golden Chicken</strong> for an instant victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/178a659c75329fbc534d972065a38eb7.poster.avif?t=1778513712\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/178a659c75329fbc534d972065a38eb7.webm?t=1778513712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/178a659c75329fbc534d972065a38eb7.mp4?t=1778513712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/30d4508b32dd1cb290f4708ae9eb137b.avif?t=1778513712\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Speed isn't enough—you must be tactical.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coop Raiding:</strong> Break into enemy bases to scatter their chickens and flip the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aerial Attacks:</strong> Launch off ramps to deliver strikes from above. <strong>Chaos is your best strategy.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/5cad7b7f01571162dd602e2a8f5411ac.avif?t=1778513712\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Complete objectives to unlock free loot and customize your egg:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky Hats:</strong> Stand out with hilarious headgear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Weapons:</strong> Smash rivals with bats, hammers, or frying pans. <strong>Look good. Hit harder.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/8cb0be106dfd22f84e43b325143e861d.poster.avif?t=1778513712\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/8cb0be106dfd22f84e43b325143e861d.webm?t=1778513712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/8cb0be106dfd22f84e43b325143e861d.mp4?t=1778513712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/483694e68a1aae409794257fece23792.avif?t=1778513712\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Designed for instant fun and &quot;just one more game&quot; sessions.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Round Matches:</strong> Adapt your strategy across different maps every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Join <strong>2v2, 3v3, or 4v4</strong> battles. <strong>Fast. Chaos. Fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/433254a033236914f3f126fbf75f15a7.avif?t=1778513712\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> High-speed movement inspired by classic racers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Chicken:</strong> A hilarious, competitive twist on a classic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Sabotage:</strong> Raid enemy coops to reset their progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Progression:</strong> Unlock skins and loot just by playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn:</strong> Simple controls with depth for pro rivalries.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601710/extras/1f05dab6ea024197243841e5e15812c3.avif?t=1778513712\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EggSmash</strong> is a high-speed scramble to hoard chickens. Reach 20 eggs first to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend or Sabotage